[{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊啊……嗯、啊、讨厌、又变得这么淫荡」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「湿答答的……手指也已经粘乎乎的了……哈啊、哈啊……」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是停不下来……","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"在房间里彼此触碰而产生的暖意，在我的内心中变得越来越炙热……如今已经从双腿间淌了出来。","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这样下去绝对睡不着的。","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、真是的……明明芳乃大人就在旁边，我……嗯、嗯嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2587","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"为什么控制不住自己呢？","art":{"background":"a2587","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"明明知道不行，却无论如何都忍不住。","art":{"background":"a2587","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"犹如被体内的那股热意所驱使，我的手擅自摩擦着湿润的下体……j","art":{"background":"a2587","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯、嗯呀……嗯、嗯嗯嗯……哈啊、哈啊……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「为什么我的身体会变成这样呢……喜欢上一个人之后，对这种事就会变得这么饥渴吗……？」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊啊啊……嗯、嗯嗯！？啊、啊、啊啊啊啊……将臣、将臣……」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"只不过叫了叫那个人的名字，淌出的蜜汁就随之增加。","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、哈啊、哈啊……我果然变得不正常了。又滴下来了……」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「要是我这幅模样被看到，会让他幻想破灭的……淫荡过头的话还是会被讨厌的吧……」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「但是……停不下来……我是不是性欲太强了……？啊、啊嗯、啊啊啊……将臣……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我喜欢跟将臣在一起。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"喜欢握着他的手，喜欢感受他身体的温度。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是……只要我感受了他的体温，当天晚上我就只有通过自慰才能得以入眠。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊啊……嗯嗯嗯嗯……哈、哈啊、哈啊……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「再……把阴蒂拨开吧……可是刺激太强烈了。而且喊得太大声的话会吵醒芳乃大人的」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊啊啊啊，但我受不了了。因为我喜欢……我好喜欢将臣，只是想到他身体就好烫……」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「喜欢，好喜欢……想着喜欢的人就湿了，这也是没办法的事……这就是恋爱」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊啊啊啊啊、真是的，不行太湿了……但是因为将臣说他喜欢我……」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……嗯、嗯嗯嗯！嗯、嗯啊、嗯啊、嗯嗯……咕唔唔唔」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「——！！啊、哈啊……哈啊……啊、轻微高潮了一下……」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「只不过想象了一下居然就变成这样……我这么下流没问题吗？」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「简直无法控制自己……这样的感觉还是第一次……啊真是的，我原来是这么奇怪的女孩子啊……」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然脑袋里是这么想的，但下面的粘稠蜜汁仍然源源不断。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"每每想起将臣的笑容，想起他对我说“我喜欢你”，我的内心就会做出反应——","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「就会变得很难受……」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"还没……还没法满足……","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"冒出这种想法之前，手指就已经动了起来。","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"手指抵在湿答答的下体，不断搓揉。","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、嗯……唔咕……哈、哈啊、哈啊、哈啊、嗯、嗯嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊呀、啊、啊……嗯、嗯啊啊啊、啊啊……这样的话，就算不剥开阴蒂……啊啊啊啊嗯！」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「要叫、叫出来了……嗯嗯嗯！嗯呼……嗯呼……嗯、嗯嗯嗯——」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯呼——嗯唔唔……嗯、嗯、嗯、嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯——」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯嗯嗯唔唔唔唔唔————————嗯嗯……！！」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……嗯、哈！哈啊……哈啊……嗯啊、哈、哈啊啊……哈啊啊……」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊啊啊嗯、嗯唔唔……又得洗个澡了……」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「茉子又发出下流的声音了……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这阵子一直都是这样。","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然不是每个晚上都能听到这种声音，但这样的日子显然已经超过了正常入睡的日子。","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"还担心会不会吵醒我……我可一直都醒着啊，茉子……","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"另外我可以确定，她的性欲真的很强……","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"可我又不好对她本人说……其实我一直没有睡着。","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是这样下去的话连我都会疯掉的。","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a276","position":"出","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊啊啊、太伤脑筋了……这种事到底该怎么办才好啊……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a1332","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我真的已经受够了啦……！」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a2627","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「咦？怎么了，出什么事了吗，芳乃？」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a263","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1706","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「丛、丛雨大人！」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a263","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a853","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「怎么了，难不成茉子她……咦？茉子哪去了？」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a363","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a853","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「她这会儿去洗澡了……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a363","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a276","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「洗澡？她又变成狗了？」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a140","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a276","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不，是因为别的事……茉子也是有自己的苦衷的」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a140","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1538","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……嗯？芳乃你没事吧？怎么脸红红的？」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a196","position":"出","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1538","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这个嘛，那个……呜呜呜呜啊啊啊……请帮帮我啊，丛雨大人～！茉子她、茉子她……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a1322","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「所以到底是怎么回事啊！？」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a142","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啾——怎么回事，感冒了吗……？」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2375","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我认为自己还是很注重健康的……难道是因为把大腿弄得太湿了吗……应该不会吧，这也太搞笑了」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2366","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"是有人在议论我吗？","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"无论如何，赶紧暖暖身子睡觉吧。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『你是傻吗？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「呃……竟然一上来就被骂了。好吧，我自己也这么认为」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a334","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「毕竟我总是像个傻瓜一样疯狂自慰……唉……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1710","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我无法理解你为什么要一个人在床上挣扎』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『想和心上人交欢，这不是很正常的事吗』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「因为一开始我们担心……做到一半时会变成狗」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a957","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我们已立下约定。我不会像人类一样毫无理由地毁约』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a957","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「这我知道。这只不过是最最开始的理由」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a257","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「而现在……可能是因为刚开始有了顾忌，所以我们有意无意间总会避开这个话题……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a326","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你怎么想？可不可以给我一些建议」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a329","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『人类的事情与我何干。我对这种无聊的烦恼毫无兴趣』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a329","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「说得真干脆啊……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1097","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『……不过有件事我挺在意的』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1097","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『你都烦恼成这样了，男方却一点回应都没有』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『即便对方是这种男人，你也不会改变主意吗？不会担心……他背叛了自己吗？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「这个嘛……如果他能主动要求，或者干脆来点更强硬、更野性的手段我也不介意……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a913","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「但他没这么做并不代表他背叛我。只能说他……不是那种贪婪任性的人」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a332","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『为什么你会这么想？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a626","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我并不觉得情侣之间必须回应对方寄予你的全部感情」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a324","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「无论多么相亲相爱，想回应对方寄予的全部感情恐怕还是不可能的」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a913","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哪怕是我，应该也无法回应将臣对我付出的所有感情」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a332","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『……这样你也能接受吗？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a332","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……我觉得唯独这个问题是没法解决的」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a292","position":"左中","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「人们是因为恋爱了才会追求回报，如果要为了回报才去恋爱的话就本末倒置了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a913","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『两者有什么区别？不是一样吗？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哪怕只是顺序不同，也会产生很大的差别」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a2626","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『……』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「而且我能感受到，他在努力回应我的心意」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a2626","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「正因为他愿意付出那样的努力……有时也会让我获得意想不到的回报」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a330","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那才是最让人怦然心动的时刻，哈哈」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a292","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『哼。我还是听不懂你在说什么』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"}]